@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

# This file uses VS Code REST Client-style named request variables.
# If your HTTP client does not support them, copy accessToken from the login
# responses and paste it into each Authorization header manually.

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/health

### List A09 demo scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/scenarios

### Failed login 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

